<title>JAPAN: HANDBALL-MEN'S WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HANDBALL-MEN'S WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUMAMOTO, Japan 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finals in the men's world handball championship on Thursday:</p>
<p> Hungary     26   Iceland	25  (halftime 14-11)</p>
<p> Sweden	28   Spain	  24  (12-12)</p>
<p> Russia	32   South Korea  15 (16-6)</p>
<p> France	22   Egypt	  19 (13-8)</p>
